1
00:04:32,307 --> 00:04:38,307
The game you couldn't put down. The story you couldn't make up.

2
00:09:04,615 --> 00:09:10,615
Tetris is a thriller, history, drama film directed by Jon S. Baird.

3
00:13:36,923 --> 00:13:42,923
In 1988, American video game salesman Henk Rogers
discovers the video game Tetris.

4
00:18:09,230 --> 00:18:15,230
When he sets out to bring the game to the world, he enters a dangerous
web of lies and corruption behind the Iron Curtain.

5
00:22:41,538 --> 00:22:47,538
Henk Rogers, played by Taron Egerton.

6
00:27:13,846 --> 00:27:19,846
Alexey Pajitnov, played by Nikita Efremov.

7
00:31:46,153 --> 00:31:52,153
Sasha, played by Sofia Lebedeva.

8
00:36:18,461 --> 00:36:24,461
Kevin Maxwell, played by Anthony Boyle.

9
00:40:50,769 --> 00:40:56,769
Howard Lincoln, played by Ben Miles.

10
00:45:23,076 --> 00:45:29,076
Minoru Arakawa, played by Ken Yamamura.

11
00:49:55,384 --> 00:50:01,384
Tetris is a 2023 biographical thriller film based on true events around the race to license and
patent the video game Tetris from Soviet Russia in the late 1980s during the Cold War.

12
00:54:27,692 --> 00:54:33,692
It was directed by Jon S.

13
00:59:00,000 --> 00:59:06,000
Baird and written by Noah Pink.

14
01:03:32,307 --> 01:03:38,307
The film stars Taron Egerton, Nikita Efremov, Sofia Lebedeva, and Anthony Boyle.

15
01:08:04,615 --> 01:08:10,615
The plot follows Henk Rogers of Bullet-Proof Software, who becomes interested in the
game Tetris, created by Alexey Pajitnov, during an electronics show.

16
01:12:36,923 --> 01:12:42,923
Desperate to obtain handheld console rights for Nintendo, he takes trips between Japan, the
United States, and Russia to win legal battles over the game's ownership.

17
01:17:09,230 --> 01:17:15,230
Development of Tetris began in July 2020.

18
01:21:41,538 --> 01:21:47,538
Filming began in Glasgow in December 2020, including Glasgow Prestwick Airport.

19
01:26:13,846 --> 01:26:19,846
In February 2021, filming took place in Aberdeen at locations
including the University of Aberdeen's Zoology Building.

20
01:30:46,153 --> 01:30:52,153
Filming took place for 7 days in and around the former (RAF)
military base at Balado in Perth & Kinross.

21
01:35:18,461 --> 01:35:24,461
Production wrapped in early March 2021.

22
01:39:50,769 --> 01:39:56,769
Tetris premiered at the SXSW Film Festival on March 15, 2023,
and was released on March 31, by Apple TV+.

23
01:44:23,076 --> 01:44:29,076
The film received generally positive reviews from critics
and was praised by Pajitnov and Rogers.

24
01:48:55,384 --> 01:49:01,384
The film explores themes of video game, nintendo, cold
war, based on true story, salesman.

25
01:53:27,692 --> 01:53:33,692
The tone is emotional and intense.
